<h2>One finger, full control</h2>

<p>A single slider takes you from a standstill to 400 km/h. No menus full of numbers. No homework. Just speed, color, and motion &mdash; the thrill of acceleration on demand, any time, no track and no ticket.</p>

<h2>Setup Lab</h2>

<p>Version 1.4 adds three ride-height stages &mdash; Serie, Sport, and Track &mdash; and the body drops visibly lower as you step through them, right over the live underbody flow. A setup-delta readout tells you exactly what each stage changes, plainly, in numbers &mdash; no ranking, no claim of a &ldquo;best&rdquo; setup, just the trade-off laid bare for you to read.</p>

<figure class="shot screen">
